{"page":416,"width":1676,"height":2486,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"476","words":[{"text":"476","x":173,"y":138,"width":58,"height":27}]},{"text":"Chapter 10 가상 에모리","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":300,"y":143,"width":115,"height":27},{"text":"10","x":428,"y":145,"width":35,"height":21},{"text":"가상","x":492,"y":145,"width":40,"height":24},{"text":"에모리","x":540,"y":145,"width":61,"height":23}]},{"text":"에서 설명하였다. 또한 ARMv8의 각 TLB 항목에는 연속 비트(contiguous bit)를 가","words":[{"text":"에서","x":301,"y":262,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"설명하였다.","x":376,"y":262,"width":154,"height":34},{"text":"또한","x":545,"y":262,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"ARMv8의","x":616,"y":263,"width":145,"height":33},{"text":"각","x":779,"y":263,"width":27,"height":33},{"text":"TLB","x":818,"y":266,"width":62,"height":27},{"text":"항목에는","x":896,"y":265,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"연속","x":1032,"y":265,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"비트(contiguous","x":1107,"y":264,"width":258,"height":39},{"text":"bit)를","x":1380,"y":265,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"가","x":1483,"y":264,"width":29,"height":34}]},{"text":"진다. 이 비트가 특정 TLB 항목에 대해 설정된 경우 해당 항목은 연속한(인접한) 메모리","words":[{"text":"진다.","x":302,"y":317,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"이","x":381,"y":317,"width":25,"height":33},{"text":"비트가","x":422,"y":317,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"특정","x":520,"y":316,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"TLB","x":589,"y":320,"width":61,"height":26},{"text":"항목에","x":663,"y":318,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"대해","x":763,"y":318,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"설정된","x":834,"y":319,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"경우","x":936,"y":320,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"해당","x":1006,"y":320,"width":61,"height":33},{"text":"항목은","x":1078,"y":320,"width":95,"height":32},{"text":"연속한(인접한)","x":1186,"y":318,"width":218,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":1419,"y":320,"width":89,"height":32}]},{"text":"블록을 매핑한다. 하나의 TLB 항목으로 1가1핑할 수 있는 연속한 블록의 배치는 3가지가","words":[{"text":"블록을","x":297,"y":372,"width":92,"height":33},{"text":"매핑한다.","x":402,"y":372,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"하나의","x":541,"y":372,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"TLB","x":640,"y":375,"width":62,"height":27},{"text":"항목으로","x":715,"y":373,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"1가1핑할","x":847,"y":374,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":948,"y":375,"width":31,"height":33},{"text":"있는","x":994,"y":375,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"연속한","x":1069,"y":373,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"블록의","x":1174,"y":374,"width":94,"height":33},{"text":"배치는","x":1287,"y":374,"width":98,"height":33},{"text":"3가지가","x":1397,"y":374,"width":115,"height":34}]},{"text":"기능하며 TLB reach를 늘릴 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"기능하며","x":297,"y":427,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"TLB","x":427,"y":430,"width":62,"height":27},{"text":"reach를","x":501,"y":429,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"늘릴","x":622,"y":428,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":691,"y":428,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":733,"y":428,"width":62,"height":34}]},{"text":"1. 16x4 KB 인접 블록으로- 구성된 64 KB TLB 항목","words":[{"text":"1.","x":322,"y":517,"width":24,"height":24},{"text":"16x4","x":371,"y":515,"width":90,"height":27},{"text":"KB","x":473,"y":515,"width":44,"height":27},{"text":"인접","x":531,"y":512,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"블록으로-","x":598,"y":512,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"구성된","x":726,"y":513,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"64","x":824,"y":517,"width":34,"height":26},{"text":"KB","x":869,"y":516,"width":45,"height":27},{"text":"TLB","x":926,"y":517,"width":63,"height":27},{"text":"항목","x":1003,"y":514,"width":61,"height":34}]},{"text":"2. 32 x32 MB 인접 블록으로 구성된 1 GB TLB 항목","words":[{"text":"2.","x":321,"y":573,"width":24,"height":25},{"text":"32","x":368,"y":571,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"x32","x":414,"y":571,"width":63,"height":28},{"text":"MB","x":489,"y":571,"width":51,"height":27},{"text":"인접","x":554,"y":568,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"블록으로","x":621,"y":569,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"구성된","x":749,"y":569,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"1","x":850,"y":573,"width":11,"height":26},{"text":"GB","x":875,"y":573,"width":47,"height":27},{"text":"TLB","x":934,"y":573,"width":63,"height":27},{"text":"항목","x":1010,"y":570,"width":62,"height":34}]},{"text":"3. 32 x 64 KB 인접 또는 128 x 16 KB 인접 블록으로 구성된 2 MB TLB 항목","words":[{"text":"3.","x":320,"y":630,"width":24,"height":26},{"text":"32","x":367,"y":629,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"x","x":413,"y":635,"width":18,"height":20},{"text":"64","x":442,"y":629,"width":33,"height":27},{"text":"KB","x":486,"y":629,"width":44,"height":26},{"text":"인접","x":544,"y":625,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"또는","x":679,"y":628,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"128","x":748,"y":629,"width":48,"height":27},{"text":"x","x":808,"y":635,"width":18,"height":20},{"text":"16","x":838,"y":630,"width":32,"height":26},{"text":"KB","x":882,"y":629,"width":44,"height":27},{"text":"인접","x":941,"y":626,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"블록으로","x":1011,"y":627,"width":125,"height":33},{"text":"구성된","x":1148,"y":626,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"2","x":1257,"y":630,"width":18,"height":26},{"text":"MB","x":1288,"y":630,"width":57,"height":26},{"text":"TLB","x":1357,"y":629,"width":68,"height":27},{"text":"항목","x":1438,"y":626,"width":63,"height":34}]},{"text":"여러 페이지 크기를 지원하는 TLB를 관리하기 위해서는 하드웨어가 아닌 운영체제","words":[{"text":"여러","x":349,"y":741,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":421,"y":741,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"크기를","x":520,"y":741,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"지원하는","x":621,"y":741,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"TLB를","x":747,"y":742,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"관리하기","x":851,"y":741,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"위해서는","x":986,"y":742,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"하드웨어가","x":1123,"y":742,"width":165,"height":34},{"text":"아닌","x":1301,"y":742,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"운영체제","x":1380,"y":742,"width":126,"height":35}]},{"text":"가 필요할 수 있다. 예를 들어, TLB 항목의 필드 중 하나는 항목에 해당하는 페이지 프","words":[{"text":"가","x":292,"y":799,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"필요할","x":336,"y":799,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":436,"y":800,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":480,"y":799,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"예를","x":558,"y":799,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"들어,","x":627,"y":798,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"TLB","x":706,"y":802,"width":61,"height":27},{"text":"항목의","x":781,"y":798,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"필드","x":884,"y":799,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"중","x":957,"y":801,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"하나는","x":1001,"y":800,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"항목에","x":1108,"y":800,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"해당하는","x":1221,"y":800,"width":132,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":1368,"y":800,"width":93,"height":34},{"text":"프","x":1478,"y":804,"width":31,"height":25}]},{"text":"레임의 크기를 나타내야 한다. 또는 ARM 아기텍처의 경우처럼 항목이 연속 메모리 블","words":[{"text":"레임의","x":293,"y":857,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"크기를","x":394,"y":857,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"나타내야","x":494,"y":857,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"한다.","x":622,"y":857,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"또는","x":701,"y":858,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"ARM","x":771,"y":860,"width":82,"height":26},{"text":"아기텍처의","x":867,"y":857,"width":149,"height":35},{"text":"경우처럼","x":1035,"y":857,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"항목이","x":1174,"y":857,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"연속","x":1289,"y":858,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"메모리","x":1368,"y":857,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"블","x":1478,"y":859,"width":31,"height":33}]},{"text":"록을 매핑한다는 사실을 나타내야 한다. 하드웨어가 아닌 소프트웨어로 TLB를 관리하","words":[{"text":"록을","x":290,"y":915,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"매핑한다는","x":365,"y":915,"width":147,"height":35},{"text":"사실을","x":526,"y":915,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"나타내야","x":627,"y":914,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"한다.","x":756,"y":914,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"하드웨어가","x":838,"y":914,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"아닌","x":1006,"y":915,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"소프트웨어로","x":1083,"y":915,"width":196,"height":35},{"text":"TLB를","x":1294,"y":917,"width":104,"height":32},{"text":"관리하","x":1413,"y":916,"width":97,"height":34}]},{"text":"면 성능이 저하된다. 그러나 적중률과 TLB reach가 증가하면 성능 손해를 상쇄한다.","words":[{"text":"면","x":293,"y":973,"width":26,"height":34},{"text":"성능이","x":333,"y":973,"width":84,"height":35},{"text":"저하된다.","x":433,"y":973,"width":121,"height":35},{"text":"그러나","x":566,"y":973,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"적중률과","x":666,"y":972,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"TLB","x":793,"y":976,"width":62,"height":27},{"text":"reach가","x":868,"y":973,"width":115,"height":35},{"text":"증가하면","x":993,"y":973,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"성능","x":1132,"y":973,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"손해를","x":1208,"y":973,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"상쇄한다.","x":1319,"y":973,"width":139,"height":35}]},{"text":"10.9.4 역 페이지 테이블 Table","words":[{"text":"10.9.4","x":289,"y":1083,"width":133,"height":28},{"text":"역","x":460,"y":1082,"width":25,"height":32},{"text":"페이지","x":496,"y":1082,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"테이블","x":590,"y":1082,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"Table","x":900,"y":1090,"width":75,"height":21}]},{"text":"9.4.3절에서 역 페이지 테이블의 개념을 소개했다. 이 페이지 관리 방식의 목적은 가상-","words":[{"text":"9.4.3절에서","x":288,"y":1153,"width":155,"height":34},{"text":"역","x":459,"y":1153,"width":24,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":498,"y":1153,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"테이블의","x":597,"y":1153,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"개념을","x":728,"y":1153,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"소개했다.","x":828,"y":1153,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":972,"y":1153,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":1014,"y":1153,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"관리","x":1120,"y":1153,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"방식의","x":1196,"y":1153,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"목적은","x":1307,"y":1153,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"가상-","x":1420,"y":1152,"width":86,"height":34}]},{"text":"물리 주소 변환을 추적하는 데 필요한 물리 메모리의 양을 줄이는 것이다. 이 테이블은","words":[{"text":"물리","x":288,"y":1210,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"주소","x":360,"y":1212,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"변환을","x":435,"y":1211,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"추적하는","x":533,"y":1211,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"데","x":666,"y":1211,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"필요한","x":709,"y":1211,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"물리","x":811,"y":1212,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"메모리의","x":886,"y":1211,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"양을","x":1023,"y":1211,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"줄이는","x":1098,"y":1211,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"것이다.","x":1213,"y":1211,"width":103,"height":35},{"text":"이","x":1335,"y":1210,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"테이블은","x":1382,"y":1209,"width":128,"height":35}]},{"text":"〈process-id, page-number〉에 의해 색인되며 각 물리 메모리마다 한 항목을 갖는다.","words":[{"text":"〈process-id,","x":292,"y":1270,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"page-number〉에","x":477,"y":1269,"width":249,"height":40},{"text":"의해","x":740,"y":1269,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"색인되며","x":811,"y":1270,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"각","x":944,"y":1270,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"물리","x":985,"y":1270,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"메모리마다","x":1060,"y":1270,"width":161,"height":34},{"text":"한","x":1232,"y":1270,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"항목을","x":1276,"y":1269,"width":100,"height":34},{"text":"갖는다.","x":1388,"y":1268,"width":103,"height":34}]},{"text":"각 페이지 프레임에 어떤 가상 메모리 페이지가 저장되어 있는지의 정보만 유지하면","words":[{"text":"각","x":344,"y":1326,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"페이지","x":385,"y":1327,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"프레임에","x":482,"y":1327,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"어떤","x":614,"y":1327,"width":56,"height":35},{"text":"가상","x":683,"y":1327,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"메모리","x":754,"y":1327,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"페이지가","x":857,"y":1328,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"저장되어","x":992,"y":1328,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"있는지의","x":1130,"y":1327,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"정보만","x":1272,"y":1326,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"유지하면","x":1381,"y":1325,"width":128,"height":35}]},{"text":"되므로 필요한 물리 메모리 양을 줄인다. 그렇지만 역 페이지 테이블이 전체 가상 주소","words":[{"text":"되므로","x":289,"y":1384,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"필요한","x":392,"y":1384,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"물리","x":491,"y":1385,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"메모리","x":564,"y":1385,"width":85,"height":35},{"text":"양을","x":666,"y":1385,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"줄인다.","x":737,"y":1385,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"그렇지만","x":851,"y":1386,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"역","x":990,"y":1385,"width":24,"height":35},{"text":"페이지","x":1033,"y":1386,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"테이블이","x":1143,"y":1385,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"전체","x":1289,"y":1384,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"가상","x":1368,"y":1383,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"주소","x":1447,"y":1384,"width":63,"height":33}]},{"text":"공간에 대한 정보는 더는 유지하지 않으므로, 참조된 페이지가 현재 메모리에 없을 때에","words":[{"text":"공간에","x":288,"y":1443,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"대한","x":390,"y":1443,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"정보는","x":461,"y":1443,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"더는","x":560,"y":1444,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"유지하지","x":629,"y":1443,"width":116,"height":35},{"text":"않으므로,","x":762,"y":1443,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"참조된","x":904,"y":1443,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"페이지가","x":1009,"y":1443,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"현재","x":1147,"y":1443,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"메모리에","x":1225,"y":1441,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"없을","x":1371,"y":1441,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"때에","x":1448,"y":1440,"width":59,"height":34}]},{"text":"는 문제가 된다. 요구된 페이지가 디스크 내 어디에 있는지를 알 수가 없기 때문이다. 이","words":[{"text":"는","x":287,"y":1503,"width":32,"height":31},{"text":"문제가","x":329,"y":1501,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"된다.","x":430,"y":1501,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"요구된","x":508,"y":1502,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"페이지가","x":609,"y":1501,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"디스크","x":740,"y":1501,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"내","x":842,"y":1501,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"어디에","x":885,"y":1502,"width":88,"height